Developed-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>



From 81c53d7d14f81ad43ec04c32a7b2878ce3521a70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateless MPEG-2 decoding

Add MPEG2_SLICE decoding with sequence and picture header synthesis,
request reference selection and incremental capture-canvas mapping.
Validate sequence dimensions against the negotiated allocation and
keep synthesis scratch in the session.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
